+RetroPane (kit 61, run 56: the traces' floats ~3.5% of the play, most of
+it PlaneDiff's subtraction, two a node): which side of a plane a point is
+on, without the subtraction. For a and d finite (no NaN, no infinity),
+a - d rounded is >= 0 exactly when a >= d and < 0 exactly when a < d
